DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
8007::$$$message_0056_0000_0000$$$::I climb the stairs to the temple gate.[lr]::
8008::$$$message_0056_0000_0001$$$::I've always been impressed that Issei and Kuzuki can go up and down these stairs every day.[lr]::
8009::$$$message_0056_0000_0002$$$::No wonder they say monks are good walkers. Just living here is a workout regimen.::
8010::$$$message_0056_0001_0000$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
8011::$$$message_0056_0001_0001$$$::Catching a flash of red, I blink.[lr]::
8012::$$$message_0056_0001_0002$$$::I didn't expect to see her here.[lr]::
8013::$$$message_0056_0001_0003$$$::"Oh, Emiya. Were you hanging out with Ryudou?"[lr]::
8014::$$$message_0056_0001_0004$$$::"I'm more surprised that you came into enemy territory. Playing as the away team, are we?"[lr]::
8015::$$$message_0056_0001_0005$$$::I greet Tohsaka.::
8016::$$$message_0056_0002_0000$$$::"Huh? Away team? That's silly. What is this, soccer?"[lr]::
8017::$$$message_0056_0002_0001$$$::"This is Issei's home base. He can't do much to you at school, but here, he's got the locals on his side."[lr]::
8018::$$$message_0056_0002_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05d(中) textoff=0]The temple is literally Issei's house. Caster and Mr. Kuzuki are here, too.[lr]::
8019::$$$message_0056_0002_0003$$$::Caster and Issei don't quite see eye to eye, but they could team up against a common enemy.::
8020::$$$message_0056_0003_0000$$$::"A mage needs to be prepared for an overwhelming disadvantage and the risk of death when venturing into the enemy's home ground...[cacheimage storage=凛私服04c(中)][wvl][chgfg storage=凛私服04c(中) time=300 textoff=0] I'm glad you remembered what I taught you, Shirou."[lr]::
8021::$$$message_0056_0003_0001$$$::Tohsaka nods, as if praising her studious pupil.::
8022::$$$message_0056_0004_0000$$$::"I guess you're right, though.[lr]::
8023::$$$message_0056_0004_0001$$$::It's not just Issei; the whole Ryudou clan aren't exactly fans of ours.[cacheimage storage=凛私服11f(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服11f(中) textoff=0] Grandfather and my dad always had trouble dealing with the folks here."[lr]::
8024::$$$message_0056_0004_0002$$$::"...Is it what I think it is?"[lr]::
8025::$$$message_0056_0004_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01e(中) textoff=0]It would be weirder for an old mage family to get along with the monks in charge of the local temple.::
8026::$$$message_0056_0005_0000$$$::"We've been stuck with each other since before Homurahara. Maybe we were archenemies in a past life."[lr]::
8027::$$$message_0056_0005_0001$$$::"Then now's as good a time as ever to put an end to that awful karmic relationship."[lr]::
8028::$$$message_0056_0005_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06d(中) textoff=0]Tohsaka seems to seriously consider him a rival, so I give her a warning. Knowing Tohsaka, if the two clans ever go to war, it can only end in the most...dynamic way possible.::
8029::$$$message_0056_0006_0000$$$::"It's rare to see you visiting shrines and temples to begin with. I thought you were part of the congregation at the church in the city."[lr]::
8030::$$$message_0056_0006_0001$$$::"...You've got it all wrong, Emiya.[lr]::
8031::$$$message_0056_0006_0002$$$::The priest and I studied under the same mentor, but ever since I learned that he was supposed to be a representative of their god, I've had zero interest in worshipping at that church."::
8032::$$$message_0056_0007_0000$$$::So that's how it is.[lr]::
8033::$$$message_0056_0007_0001$$$::[chgfg storage=凛私服06d(中) time=400 textoff=0]Tohsaka lives a completely Western lifestyle, so I never questioned it. She lives in a European-style mansion, and she even went to study abroad after we graduated.[lr]::
8034::$$$message_0056_0007_0002$$$::But if the local priest was Kirei Kotomine, then she wouldn't want to be a part of his religion. Even I'd think twice.::
8035::$$$message_0056_0008_0000$$$::"It's true that in our trade, we can't accept any religions or sects, but going out of your way to insist that you're agnostic can invite unwanted attention, too."[lr]::
8036::$$$message_0056_0008_0001$$$::"It's better not to stand out, then?"[lr]::
8037::$$$message_0056_0008_0002$$$::"Luckily for us, it's easy to pretend to follow whatever religion you want in this country. Nobody will hassle you about it."[lr]::
8038::$$$message_0056_0008_0003$$$::It's true; citizens will visit a Shinto shrine for the New Year, hold Buddhist ceremonies for Obon and the equinox, and then celebrate Christmas.::
8039::$$$message_0056_0009_0000$$$::"Of course, we can't let our guard down. You never know when some religious type with keen spiritual senses or dharmic power might try to look into us."[lr]::
8040::$$$message_0056_0009_0001$$$::"Got it, I'll be careful... Still, the fact that you're at the temple is..."[lr]::
8041::$$$message_0056_0009_0002$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服05b(中) textoff=0]Quite disconcerting, especially after hearing all that.[lr]::
8042::$$$message_0056_0009_0003$$$::Though, Sakura or Saber wouldn't seem out of place in this tranquil environment.::
8043::$$$message_0056_0010_0000$$$::"...You look like you've got something to say, Shirou."[lr]::
8044::$$$message_0056_0010_0001$$$::"Can you blame me?"[lr]::
8045::$$$message_0056_0010_0002$$$::"I'll have you know that I serve as a shrine maiden during the New Year holidays."[lr]::
8046::$$$message_0056_0010_0003$$$::......What?[lr]::
8047::$$$message_0056_0010_0004$$$::Tohsaka is a shrine maiden? That's news to me.::
8048::$$$message_0056_0011_0000$$$::"At Ryudou Temple!?"[lr]::
8049::$$$message_0056_0011_0001$$$::"[font italic=true]Please.[font italic=false] Can you imagine if Ryudou saw me dressed as a shrine maiden? He'd throw a tantrum about an impure woman's spirit trespassing on sacred ground. [cacheimage storage=凛私服03a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03a(中) textoff=0]Obviously, it's at a Shinto shrine in the city."[lr]::
8050::$$$message_0056_0011_0002$$$::Thank goodness for small mercies.[lr]::
8051::$$$message_0056_0011_0003$$$::...But why a shrine maiden?::
8052::$$$message_0056_0012_0000$$$::"Does it have something to do with your family, like you have to send one representative each year to help at the shrine?"[lr]::
8053::$$$message_0056_0012_0001$$$::"You make it sound like I'm some feudal hostage princess... [cacheimage storage=凛私服13a(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服13a(中) textoff=0]No, it's just a part-time gig that pays well around the holidays. I get treated favorably since I'm experienced."[lr]::
8054::$$$message_0056_0012_0002$$$::I brace myself for a dramatic explanation...only to be disappointed. That's right, I remember Issei mentioning that most of the shrine maidens working during the holidays are seasonal part-timers.::
8055::$$$message_0056_0013_0000$$$::"So yeah, it's not like I go out of my way to avoid temples or anything like that."[lr]::
8056::$$$message_0056_0013_0001$$$::"Huh...a part-time job. You must have it rough."[lr]::
8057::$$$message_0056_0013_0002$$$::I just say what I'm feeling.[lr]::
8058::$$$message_0056_0013_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服06b(中) textoff=0]I didn't mean anything by it, but Tohsaka's eyebrows shoot up.::
8059::$$$message_0056_0014_0000$$$::"I'll manage, even if it isn't a full-time job. [cacheimage storage=凛私服01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服01d(中) textoff=0]Wanna give the New Year's shrine work a try, Shirou?"[lr]::
8060::$$$message_0056_0014_0001$$$::"Me?"[lr]::
8061::$$$message_0056_0014_0002$$$::I'd be wearing that light-blue Shinto outfit.[lr]::
8062::$$$message_0056_0014_0003$$$::I'm not particularly opposed since it's mostly the same as the kyudo attire... But in my case...::
8063::$$$message_0056_0015_0000$$$::"I feel like it would make more sense for me to work as security and wear a zip-up jacket and overcoat, waving a carrot around."[lr]::
8064::$$$message_0056_0015_0001$$$::"Yeah, that might fit you better. [cacheimage storage=凛私服01e(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg storage=凛私服01e(中) time=300 textoff=0]Anyway, I can't ignore what happens on this mountain, so I check in on it once in a while."[lr]::
8065::$$$message_0056_0015_0002$$$::Tohsaka finally touches on her reason for being here.[lr]::
8066::$$$message_0056_0015_0003$$$::It is a temple built on an important nexus of leylines, so she has to pay attention to it.::
8067::$$$message_0056_0016_0000$$$::"I see. Are you going to pay your respects, too?"[lr]::
8068::$$$message_0056_0016_0001$$$::"I don't need to go into the actual building. Just the pond in the back and the cave underground...[cacheimage storage=凛私服03d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=300][chgfg time=300 storage=凛私服03d(中) textoff=0] What about you, Shirou?"::
8069::$$$message_0056_0017_0000$$$::She asks me if I want to go with her.[lr]::
8070::$$$message_0056_0017_0001$$$::I think I'd just get in the way of her work, though.[lr]::
8071::$$$message_0056_0017_0002$$$::When I shake my head to say no, Tohsaka answers, her expression composed.::
8072::$$$message_0056_0018_0000$$$::"Okay. Then would you mind going through the front to cause a diversion, so I don't run into Ryudou?"[lr]::
8073::$$$message_0056_0018_0001$$$::"...I mean, if I see him, sure."[lr]::
8074::$$$message_0056_0018_0002$$$::Tohsaka chuckles wryly and slips past the gate.[lr]::
8075::$$$message_0056_0018_0003$$$::Just before cutting across the courtyard, she turns back to me.::
8076::$$$message_0056_0019_0000$$$::"...Wanna see me in my shrine maiden dress?"[lr]::
8077::$$$message_0056_0019_0001$$$::"Honestly, yeah, I'm interested."[lr]::
8078::$$$message_0056_0019_0002$$$::"Hehehe. Look forward to it, then."[lr]::
8079::$$$message_0056_0019_0003$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]Tohsaka gives me a rather suggestive smile and leaves.[lr]::
8080::$$$message_0056_0019_0004$$$::Tohsaka as a shrine maiden... I'm definitely curious.::
908013::$$$message_9056_0001_0003$$$::"Oh, Emiya. Were you hanging out with Ryudou?"[r]::

